<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title { margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .content-block { margin-bottom: 15px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <header>
    <h1><span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span> Rehearsal Report</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>DATE: <span data-field="report_date">{{ report_date }}</span></p>
    <p>LOCATION: <span data-field="report_location">{{ report_location }}</span></p>
    <p>REPORT #: <span data-field="report_number">{{ report_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">REHEARSAL DESCRIPTION:</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>7:30pm-8:00pm – Welcoming Sam Fidler</p>
    <p>8:00pm-9:00pm – Act 1 Scene 1</p>
    <p>9:00pm-11:00pm – Breeze Through Act 1</p>
    <p>11:00pm – END OF DAY</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">GENERAL NOTES:</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <ul>
      <li>Bios for the program are due one week from today, <span data-field="bios_due_date">{{ bios_due_date }}</span>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">DEPARTMENT NOTES:</div>

  <div class="section-title">SCENIC</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>1. How big do you envision the area of treated floor around the Investigator's table?</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">PROPS</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>1. Thank you for the furniture!</p>
    <p>2. Joe likes the treatment on the Investigator Table, the only thing that needs to be altered are painting in a few small gashes in the wood where the paint was chipped.</p>
    <p>3. Would it be possible to get a few pieces of rehearsal glassware this week? 2 wine glasses, 2 rocks glasses, 2 wine bottles, and 2 whiskey bottles should be plenty for now.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">LIGHTING</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>1. Related to scenic note #1, how big of a playing space around the table are you planning to light during the scenes with the Investigator?</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">COSTUMES</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Nothing to report, thank you!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">SOUND</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>1. Joe will be in touch with his availability for a Sound/Direction meeting. Thank you!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">PRODUCTION MANAGEMENT</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>1. See Sound Note #1 Thank you!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">NEXT REHEARSAL:</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p><span data-field="next_rehearsal_date">{{ next_rehearsal_date }}</span>, <span data-field="next_rehearsal_time">{{ next_rehearsal_time }}</span> in the <span data-field="next_rehearsal_location">{{ next_rehearsal_location }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">NEXT PRODUCTION MEETING:</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p><span data-field="next_meeting_date">{{ next_meeting_date }}</span>, <span data-field="next_meeting_time">{{ next_meeting_time }}</span> in the <span data-field="next_meeting_location">{{ next_meeting_location }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <footer style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.9em; text-align: center;">
    <p>Please contact <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span> with any questions or concerns</p>
    <p><span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span> or <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
    <p>1/1</p>
  </footer>
</div>